IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `P3-section-3`

-- Tests of the gate. Expected values are written from the text: Art 113(c)(i) gives 2 December 2027 for an Annex III system and (c)(ii) gives
-- 2 August 2028 for an Annex I system; Art 111(2) saves a system placed earlier and not significantly changed; Art 2(2) cuts off Articles 16 to 27
-- for an Article 6(1) system with Section B products; Art 2(13) lets the application of Articles 17 to 25 (not 16, 26, 27) be limited.

§ `Fixtures`

`P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 8 2028
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 legacy Annex III system placed 1 January 2027` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 legacy Annex III system placed 1 January 2027 and changed` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS TRUE

`P3 system that is not high-risk` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route neither`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 plain circumstances` MEANS `Section 3 circumstances` WITH
    `related to Section B products` IS FALSE
    `Section A equivalent protection` IS FALSE
    `no reduction of the overall level of protection` IS FALSE

`P3 Section B circumstances` MEANS `Section 3 circumstances` WITH
    `related to Section B products` IS TRUE
    `Section A equivalent protection` IS FALSE
    `no reduction of the overall level of protection` IS FALSE

`P3 equivalent protection circumstances` MEANS `Section 3 circumstances` WITH
    `related to Section B products` IS FALSE
    `Section A equivalent protection` IS TRUE
    `no reduction of the overall level of protection` IS TRUE

`P3 equivalent protection but a reduction` MEANS `Section 3 circumstances` WITH
    `related to Section B products` IS FALSE
    `Section A equivalent protection` IS TRUE
    `no reduction of the overall level of protection` IS FALSE

`P3 Article 16` MEANS `Article reference` OF 16, "", 0
`P3 Article 17` MEANS `Article reference` OF 17, "", 0
`P3 Article 25` MEANS `Article reference` OF 25, "", 0
`P3 Article 26` MEANS `Article reference` OF 26, "", 0
`P3 Article 27` MEANS `Article reference` OF 27, "", 0

§ `Chapter III Sections 1 to 3: before, on and after the date of application (Art 113(c))`

-- Annex III system: 1 December 2027 is the day before the date; the gate is shut. On 2 December 2027 and later it is open.
#ASSERT `Section 3 gate` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 Article 16` EQUALS `Section 3 not applicable on the date asked`
#ASSERT `Section 3 gate` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 Article 16` EQUALS `Section 3 applies`
#ASSERT `Section 3 gate` (Date 3 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 Article 16` EQUALS `Section 3 applies`
-- Annex I system: 2 December 2027 is too early (its date is 2 August 2028, Art 113(c)(ii)); 1 August 2028 too early, 2 August 2028 open.
#ASSERT `Section 3 gate` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 Article 16` EQUALS `Section 3 not applicable on the date asked`
#ASSERT `Section 3 gate` (Date 1 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 Article 16` EQUALS `Section 3 not applicable on the date asked`
#ASSERT `Section 3 gate` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 Article 16` EQUALS `Section 3 applies`
-- Art 111(2): a system placed before the date of application and not significantly changed is saved (shut); changed, it is covered.
#ASSERT `Section 3 gate` (Date 2 12 2030) `P3 legacy Annex III system placed 1 January 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 Article 16` EQUALS `Section 3 not applicable on the date asked`
#ASSERT `Section 3 gate` (Date 2 12 2030) `P3 legacy Annex III system placed 1 January 2027 and changed` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 Article 16` EQUALS `Section 3 applies`
-- A system that is not high-risk has no date under Chapter III Sections 1 to 3.
#ASSERT `Section 3 gate` (Date 2 12 2030) `P3 system that is not high-risk` `P3 plain circumstances` `P3 Article 16` EQUALS `Section 3 not applicable on the date asked`

§ `Art 2(2): Article 6(1) systems related to Section B products are cut off from Articles 16 to 27`

-- Before 2 August 2028 the gate is shut first (nothing applies yet); from that date Article 2(2) answers JUST FALSE for these Articles.
#ASSERT `Section 3 gate` (Date 1 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 Section B circumstances` `P3 Article 16` EQUALS `Section 3 not applicable on the date asked`
#ASSERT `Section 3 gate` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 Section B circumstances` `P3 Article 16` EQUALS `Section 3 cut off by Article 2(2)`
#ASSERT `Section 3 gate` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 Section B circumstances` `P3 Article 26` EQUALS `Section 3 cut off by Article 2(2)`
-- A Section B flag does not matter to an Annex III system (Art 2(2) speaks of Article 6(1) systems only).
#ASSERT `Section 3 gate` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 Section B circumstances` `P3 Article 16` EQUALS `Section 3 applies`
-- What a function answers for each gate result.
#ASSERT `Section 3 the answer when the gate is shut` `Section 3 cut off by Article 2(2)` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Section 3 the answer when the gate is shut` `Section 3 not applicable on the date asked` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Section 3 the answer when the gate is shut` `Section 3 may be limited under Article 2(13)` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Section 3 the gate is open` `Section 3 applies`
#ASSERT NOT (`Section 3 the gate is open` `Section 3 cut off by Article 2(2)`)
#ASSERT NOT (`Section 3 the gate is open` `Section 3 not applicable on the date asked`)

§ `Art 2(13): the application of Articles 17 to 25 may be limited for an Article 6(1) system (not Articles 16, 26, 27)`

-- Both conditions of Art 2(13)(a) and (b) hold: Articles 17 and 25 are limitable; Articles 16, 26 and 27 are not on the list "Articles 9 to 15 and 17 to 25".
#ASSERT `Section 3 gate` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 equivalent protection circumstances` `P3 Article 17` EQUALS `Section 3 may be limited under Article 2(13)`
#ASSERT `Section 3 gate` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 equivalent protection circumstances` `P3 Article 25` EQUALS `Section 3 may be limited under Article 2(13)`
#ASSERT `Section 3 gate` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 equivalent protection circumstances` `P3 Article 16` EQUALS `Section 3 applies`
#ASSERT `Section 3 gate` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 equivalent protection circumstances` `P3 Article 26` EQUALS `Section 3 applies`
#ASSERT `Section 3 gate` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 equivalent protection circumstances` `P3 Article 27` EQUALS `Section 3 applies`
-- A reduction of the overall level of protection (limb (b) fails): not limitable; the Article applies in full.
#ASSERT `Section 3 gate` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 equivalent protection but a reduction` `P3 Article 17` EQUALS `Section 3 applies`
-- Art 2(13) concerns systems referred to in Article 6(1): an Annex III system stays in full.
#ASSERT `Section 3 gate` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 equivalent protection circumstances` `P3 Article 17` EQUALS `Section 3 applies`
-- Art 2(13) is in the text as amended only; as enacted it answers NOTHING (and Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 had no date before 27 July 2026 anyway).
#ASSERT `Section 3 gate` (Date 1 7 2026) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 equivalent protection circumstances` `P3 Article 17` EQUALS `Section 3 not applicable on the date asked`
